  "slug": "roofing-safety-walk-checklist-form",
  "title": "Roofing Safety Walk and Corrective Action Checklist",
  "subtitle": "Plan the roofing walk, observe critical controls and changing conditions, stop or contain immediate hazards, assign corrective actions, verify closure, and hand off residual risk.",
  "description": "A practical Roofing safety walk covering site and crew routing, work phases and interfaces, trade-specific hazard prompts, observation evidence, immediate controls, corrective-action ownership, stop-work and incident routing, repeat findings, verification, trend review, and accountable closeout.",
  "use_case": "Use when the roofing foreperson, supervisor, competent or qualified personnel, and safety management need a documented Roofing field walk that supports the site program but never substitutes for required permits, training, or inspections.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
  "sections": [
